# 🚀 CRDTs (Conflict-free Replicated Data Types)

> **Goal:** Distributed systems mein multiple nodes agar **same data ko ek saath update kare**, to bina kisi central server aur bina manual conflict resolution ke **eventually same final state** par pahunchna.

---

# 📌 Pehle Problem Samajhte Hain

Suppose 2 users alag-alag cities se Shopping Cart update kar rahe hain.

```
India User

↓

Add Laptop
```

Aur usi time

```
USA User

↓

Add Mouse
```

Ab dono updates different servers par chale gaye.

```
          Cart

         /     \

        /       \

Leader A      Leader B

Laptop         Mouse
```

Ab merge kaise kare?

Naive Solution

```
Latest Write Wins

↓

Laptop ❌

Mouse ✅
```

Ya

```
Mouse ❌

Laptop ✅
```

Ek item lose ho gaya.

Ye hi problem CRDT solve karta hai.

---

# 🤔 What is CRDT?

CRDT ka full form

> **Conflict-free Replicated Data Type**

Simple Definition

> **Aisa Data Structure jo distributed environment mein automatic conflict resolve karta hai aur sab nodes eventually same result par pahunch jaate hain.**

Matlab

```
No Manual Merge

No Data Loss

No Central Leader
```

---

# 🧠 Why do we need CRDT?

Distributed Systems mein

```
Multiple Users

↓

Multiple Servers

↓

Multiple Writes

↓

Conflicts 😭
```

Traditional databases bolte hain

```
Choose One Winner
```

CRDT bolta hai

```
Merge Everything Correctly 😎
```

