# Merge Function ke 3 Golden Rules

Interview mein almost fix question.

Merge function hona chahiye

```
Commutative

Associative

Idempotent
```

Let's understand one by one.

---

# 1️⃣ Commutative

Meaning

Order doesn't matter.

```
A + B

=

B + A
```

---

## Real Life Example

Shopping Cart

```
Laptop

+

Mouse
```

Ya

```
Mouse

+

Laptop
```

Result same.

---

# 2️⃣ Associative

Grouping doesn't matter.

```
(A+B)+C

=

A+(B+C)
```

---

## Example

```
Laptop

Mouse

Keyboard
```

Merge pehle

```
Laptop+Mouse
```

ya

```
Mouse+Keyboard
```

Result same.

---

# 3️⃣ Idempotent

Same update multiple baar aaye

Tab bhi result same rehna chahiye.

```
Merge(A,A)

=

A
```

---

## Real Life Example

Friend ne same photo 3 baar WhatsApp pe bhej di.

Gallery mein ideally

```
One Photo
```

Na ki

```
Three Copies
```

---

# Why are these properties important?

Distributed systems mein

```
Messages

Late

Duplicate

Random Order
```

mein aa sakte hain.

Fir bhi final state

same honi chahiye.

Isi liye ye properties mandatory hain.

