# 📊 Operational vs State-based CRDT

| Feature | Operational CRDT | State-based CRDT |
|----------|------------------|------------------|
| Send | Operations | Complete State |
| Network Cost | Very Low | Higher |
| Space | O(1) | O(State Size) |
| Needs Message Order? | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| Duplicate Messages | Not Allowed | Safe (Idempotent Merge) |
| Common Use | Fast Operations | Gossip Protocol |

