# ⚖️ Version Vector vs CRDT

| Version Vector | CRDT |
|----------------|------|
| Detects Conflict | Avoids Conflict |
| Needs Resolution Later | Automatically Merges |
| Stores History | Stores Mergeable State |
| Application Resolves | Data Structure Resolves |

